    "What exactly should the model optimize — minimize the total fuel cost of the two methods, or is there another objective (e.g., minimize total time, or just find any feasible allocation)?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy choice regarding the optimization objective, presenting alternatives within one coherent question."
}

