    "Is the time limit of 12 hours a cap on the total time summed across both furnaces (i.e., the sum of the two furnaces' batch times must be ≤ 12), or is it a cap on the makespan (i.e., each furnace individually must finish within 12 hours)?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy choice between two mutually exclusive interpretations of the time limit constraint."
}

